# Supabase
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.branches/

# Database exports never belong in the repository: they carry employee ID
# numbers, salaries, addresses, customer records and password hashes. Keep the
# directory itself so the tooling has somewhere to write.
backups/*
!backups/README.md
*.sql
*.dump
!core/migrations/*.sql
